      "content": "it's just hard to see a point in \"finding a new self\" when that whole version of me is what made life worth living. it feels like i'm just performing a role for no audience. if the soul of who i was is gone, what's even the point of this biological leftovers? it's like keeping a device powered on when the software is completely wiped. it just feels hollow and pointless to exist like this.",
